    "bbb0cacc-38e8-467f-862e-7823973c78d4": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16629528068339__bbb0cacc-38e8-467f-862e-7823973c78d4-1665327871bdde5173-0": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>It’s better than I expected po. It’s very comfortable and it isn’t as restricting as it looks. I love how adjustable it is. The mask helped me out a lot po! I work nights po kasi, kaya it’s a must have for me. I appreciate the free earplugs din po. Again, thank you for making this! I’ll be getting the weighted blanket next po :)  <strong>[Ea, Facebook]</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629528068339__bbb0cacc-38e8-467f-862e-7823973c78d4-1665327871bdde5173-1": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>I like that the eye patches can be adjusted so I can align them with my eyes. They are blackout and super soft. Tried it the first time and I had better sleep than the other nights I was using a regular sleep mask (like the ones in airline flights) so that’s amazing. Perfect for anyone who has trouble sleeping at night or people like mo who work graveyard shifts and have trouble sleeping in the middle of the day! <strong>[Bethany, Instagram]</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "template--16629528068339__bbb0cacc-38e8-467f-862e-7823973c78d4-1665327871bdde5173-2": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "text": "<p>By the way, this one works like wonder! Used this during one of my trips, and I had one of my best travel sleeps ever. Super comfortable and absolutely zero lights. The thing with this mask though is that you can still open your eyes coz of the way it is constructed. And when you open your eyes it’s still totally dark. With typical masks, you cannot open your eyes coz the cloth presses your eyelids shut. <strong>[Francis, Instagram]</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
