        "template--16629528068339__28589fcf-518c-4284-b59c-2ef2eea5ae18-1665327871d606a5fd-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>I like that the eye patches can be adjusted so I can align them with my eyes. They are blackout and super soft. Tried it the first time and I had better sleep than the other nights I was using a regular sleep mask (like the ones in airline flights) so that’s amazing. Perfect for anyone who has trouble sleeping at night or people like mo who work graveyard shifts and have trouble sleeping in the middle of the day! <strong>[Bethany, Instagram]</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
