          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>They keep me cool while sleeping. Sheets are soft and cozy. I’ve tried other brands and materials like cotton and silk sheets but nothing compares to this Bamboo bed sheet <strong>[Jenny, Email]</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
