          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Hands down the best sheets available! Nothing can beat a great night’s sleep with these sheets and a weighted blanket. Thank you so much for making such high-quality products! <strong>[Nancy, Facebook]</strong></p>"
